# Breast Cancer Classification using GNN

This project performs breast cancer classification using a Graph Neural Network (GCN) built with PyTorch Geometric.

## Features

- Breast cancer dataset classification
- Graph construction using KNN
- GCN architecture
- Accuracy evaluation
- t-SNE embedding visualization
- Graph visualization

## Technologies Used

- PyTorch
- PyTorch Geometric
- Scikit-learn
- NetworkX
- Matplotlib

## Run Project

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python train.py